Package: dungx.wifibruter-rootless
Name: WiFiBruter (Rootless)
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader
Version: 1.0-1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Section: Tweaks
Maintainer: dungx
Description: Automatically attempts WiFi passcodes from a wordlist on jailbroken iOS. Rootless variant. Configurable from the Settings app. Primarily targets iOS 12 and iOS 15. For authorized security testing only.
